ight:846px"><header class="timeline-intro" style="width:600px"><p class="timeline-intro__eyebrow">De la Création à l’Apocalypse</p><h1>Chronologie biblique</h1><p class="timeline-intro__lead">625 personnages et événements sur une seule ligne du temps. Faites glisser pour voyager, ouvrez un événement pour le découvrir.</p><a class="resource-cta" href="#period-1" data-period="1">Commencer le voyage<svg aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8h10M9 4l4 4-4 4"></path></svg></a></header><section class="timeline-period" style="left:600px;width:1200px;--timeline-period:#ad1f26"><span id="period-1" class="timeline-period__anchor"></span><div class="timeline-period__scene"><img src="/images/timeline/period-1.jpg" alt="" width="640" height="800" decoding="async"/></div><div class="timeline-period__name"><p class="timeline-period__era"><span class="timeline-period__number">01</span>L’ère des patriarches</p><h2>Première génération</h2><p class="timeline-period__span">Création – v. 2500 av. J.-C.</p><p class="timeline-period__summary">De la création d’Adam et Ève, au meurtre d’Abel par Caïn, et à l’histoire de l’humanité avant le déluge.</p></div></section><section class="timeline-period" style="left:1800px;width:3800px;--timeline-period:#db2f2c"><span id="period-2" class="timeline-period__anchor"></span><div class="timeline-period__scene"><img src="/images/timeline/period-2.jpg" alt="" width="640" height="800" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><div class="timeline-period__name"><p class="timeline-period__era"><span class="timeline-period__number">02</span>L’ère des patriarches</p><h2>Noé et le déluge</h2><p class="timeline-period__span">v. 2500 – v. 2166 av. J.-C.</p><p class="timeline-period__summary">Du ministère de Noé et du déluge mondial à Cush, Nimrod et la tour de Babel.</p></div></section><section class="timeline-period" style="left:5600px;width:6000px;--timeline-period:#bb3380"><span id="period-3" class="timeline-period__anchor"></span><div class="timeline-period__scene"><img src="/images/timeline/period-3.jpg" alt="" width="640" height="800" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><div class="timeline-period__name"><p class="timeline-period__era"><span class="timeline-period__number">03</span>L’ère des patriarches</p><h2>Les patriarches</h2><p class="timeline-period__span">v. 2166 – v. 1660 av. J.-C.</p><p class="timeline-period__summary">De l’appel d’Abraham, à Sodome et Gomorrhe, à l’ascension des 12 tribus juives en passant par Isaac et Jacob.</p></div></section><section class="timeline-period" style="left:11600px;width:800px;--timeline-period:#903a95"><span id="period-4" class="timeline-period__anchor"></span><div class="timeline-period__scene"><img src="/images/timeline/period-4.jpg" alt="" width="640" height="800" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><div class="timeline-period__name"><p class="timeline-period__era"><span class="timeline-period__number">04</span>L’ère d’Israël</p><h2>Israël en Égypte</h2><p class="timeline-period__span">v. 1660 – v. 1445 av. J.-C.</p><p class="timeline-period__summary">De la vente de Joseph en esclavage, à sa montée en puissance en Égypte, en passant par Moïse et l’Exode.</p></div></section><section class="timeline-period" style="left:12400px;width:3500px;--timeline-period:#63479b"><span id="period-5" class="timeline-period__anchor"></span><div class="timeline-period__scene"><img src="/images/timeline/period-5.jpg" alt="" width="640" height="800" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><div class="timeline-period__name"><p class="timeline-period__era"><span class="timeline-period__number">05</span>L’ère d’Israël</p><h2>Les Juges</h2><p class="timeline-period__span">v. 1445 – v. 1050 av. J.-C.</p><p class="timeline-period__summary">De Moïse et les dix commandements à l’entrée de Josué et à l’expansion juive en Terre promise.</p></div></section><section class="timeline-period" style="left:15900px;width:8500px;--timeline-period:#3b6eb5"><span id="period-6" class="timeline-period__anchor"></span><div class="timeline-period__scene"><img src="/images/timeline/period-6.jpg" alt="" width="640" height="800" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><div class="timeline-period__name"><p class="timeline-period__era"><span class="timeline-period__number">06</span>L’ère d’Israël</p><h2>Le royaume uni</h2><p class="timeline-period__span">v. 1050 – v. 930 av. J.-C.</p><p class="timeline-period__summary">Du roi Saül au prophète Samuel et au jeune roi David et sa dynastie royale en passant par Salomon.</p></div></section><section class="timeline-period" style="left:24400px;width:15500px;--timeline-period:#23a6c5"><span id="period-7" class="timeline-period__anchor"></span><div class="timeline-period__scene"><img src="/images/timeline/period-7.jpg" alt="" width="640" height="800" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><div class="timeline-period__name"><p class="timeline-period__era"><span class="timeline-period__number">07</span>L’ère d’Israël</p><h2>Le royaume divisé</h2><p class="timeline-period__span">v. 930 – v. 586 av. J.-C.</p><p class="timeline-period__summary">Des conflits internes qui ont divisé la nation d’Israël aux prophètes qui ont averti de l’exil à venir.</p></div></section><section class="timeline-period" style="left:39900px;width:10400px;--timeline-period:#33bdbb"><span id="period-8" class="timeline-period__anchor"></span><div class="timeline-period__scene"><img src="/images/timeline/period-8.jpg" alt="" width="640" height="800" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><div class="timeline-period__name"><p class="timeline-period__era"><span class="timeline-period__number">08</span>L’ère d’Israël</p><h2>L’Exil</h2><p class="timeline-period__span">v. 585 – v. 457 av. J.-C.</p><p class="timeline-period__summary">De la chute d’Israël à l’exil à Babylone et aux grands prophètes déclarant le Messie à venir.</p></div></section><section class="timeline-period" style="left:50300px;width:16000px;--timeline-period:#52b148"><span id="period-9" class="timeline-period__anchor"></span><div class="timeline-period__scene"><img src="/images/timeline/period-9.jpg" alt="" width="640" height="800" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><div class="timeline-period__name"><p class="timeline-period__era"><span class="timeline-period__number">09</span>L’ère de Christ</p><h2>La vie de Christ</h2><p class="timeline-period__span">v. 4 av. J.-C. – v. 34 ap. J.-C.</p><p class="timeline-period__summary">Depuis la naissance du Messie promis, Jésus le Christ, jusqu’à son ministère, sa mort et sa résurrection.</p></div></section><section class="timeline-period" style="left:66300px;width:6300px;--timeline-period:#b6bf34"><span id="period-10" class="timeline-period__anchor"></span><div class="timeline-period__scene"><img src="/images/timeline/period-10.jpg" alt="" width="640" height="800" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><div class="timeline-period__name"><p class="timeline-period__era"><span class="timeline-period__number">10</span>L’ère de Christ</p><h2>L’Église primitive</h2><p class="timeline-period__span">v. 34 – v. 330 ap. J.-C.</p><p class="timeline-period__summary">Du martyre d’Étienne à la persécution et à l’ascension de l’Église par Paul et les apôtres.</p></div></section><section class="timeline-period" style="left:72600px;width:5850px;--timeline-period:#eec826"><span id="period-11" class="timeline-period__anchor"></span><div class="timeline-period__scene"><img src="/images/timeline/period-11.jpg" alt="" width="640" height="800" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><div class="timeline-period__name"><p class="timeline-period__era"><span class="timeline-period__number">11</span>L’ère de Christ</p><h2>Le Moyen Âge</h2><p class="timeline-period__span">v. 450 – v. 1517 ap. J.-C.</p><p class="timeline-period__summary">De la légalisation du christianisme sous Constantin à la persécution de l’âge des ténèbres.</p></div></section><section class="timeline-period" style="left:78450px;width:16000px;--timeline-period:#e9a327"><span id="period-12" class="timeline-period__anchor"></span><div class="timeline-period__scene"><img src="/images/timeline/period-12.jpg" alt="" width="640" height="800" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><div class="timeline-period__name"><p class="timeline-period__era"><span class="timeline-period__number">12</span>L’ère de Christ</p><h2>Réformation</h2><p class="timeline-period__span">v. 1517 – v. 1840 ap. J.-C.</p><p class="timeline-period__summary">Des grands réformateurs, tels que Luther et Wycliffe, à l’expansion du mouvement protestant.</p></div></section><section class="timeline-period" style="left:94450px;width:5040px;--timeline-period:#ed7c2c"><span id="period-13" class="timeline-period__anchor"></span><div class="timeline-period__scene"><img src="/images/timeline/period-13.jpg" alt="" width="640" height="800" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div><div class="timeline-period__name"><p class="timeline-period__era"><span class="timeline-period__number">13</span>L’ère de Christ</p><h2>Prophéties de l’Apocalypse</h2><p class="timeline-period__summary">De la montée de l’Antéchrist, la marque de la bête, au retour du Christ et à la restauration du paradis.</p></div></section><footer class="timeline-outro" style="left:99490px;width:520px"><h2>La frise s’arrête ici</h2><p>Reprenez le voyage depuis le début, ou poursuivez dans une autre section.</p><a class="resource-cta" href="#period-1" data-period="1">Revenir à la Création</a><ul><li><a href="/fr/bible">Bible</a></li><li><a href="/strong/fr">Lexique</a></li><li><a href="/dictionary/fr">Dictionnaire</a></li><li><a href="/nave/fr">Thèmes</a></li><li><a href="/commentary/fr">Commentaires</a></li></ul></footer><div class="timeline-world" style="height:786px"><a id="on-adam" href="/timeline/fr/adam" data-event="adam" class="timeline-item timeline-item--card" style="left:746px;top:706px;width:930px;--timeline-period:#ad1f26"><span class="timeline-card"><img src="https://media.bible-strong.app/timeline-images/w480/